## Surface differences

Hooks, `.claude/settings.json` permissions, and subagents are Claude Code affordances and
do nothing under Codex or Gemini. **Nothing in this project depends on them.** The gate is
a script for exactly that reason: whatever is running, `node scripts/gate.mjs` behaves
identically, including in CI.

